body:
Minikube definitely **isn't** a dependency to running the tests, so there is something else funny going on here.

@emmanuelbernard can you please check `/Users/emmanuel/.kube/config` and see if there is any reference to minikube? 

@iocanel what would be the way to have https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/blob/master/test-framework/kubernetes-client/src/main/java/io/quarkus/test/kubernetes/client/KubernetesMockServerTestResource.java#L18 completely ignore the user's `.kube/config` file?
